       "Fused ancient Greek 'genos' (race, tribe) with Latin '-cide' (killing) in his 1944 book 'Axis Rule in Occupied Europe.'",
       "Tirelessly lobbied UN delegates single-handedly until the Genocide Convention passed unanimously on December 9, 1948—one day before the Universal Declaration of Human Rights!",
